OL,3,GNEWSAHeart surgery survivor, 11, wins
OL,4,Akarting crown
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boy who underwent three open-heart
OL,7,Foperations has urged other children to
OL,8,F"follow their dreams" after he was
OL,9,Fcrowned a national karting champion.
OL,11,FDaniel, 11, was born with a complex
OL,12,Fheart condition that saw him spend the
OL,13,Ffirst six months of his life in and out
OL,14,Fof hospital.
OL,16,FDespite his condition, Daniel remained
OL,17,Factive and took up karting when he was
OL,18,Ffour, culminating in his national
OL,19,Fchampionship win this year.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
