OL,3,GNEWSAHeart surgery survivor, 11, wins
OL,4,Akarting crown
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter picking up his trophy at
OL,7,FSilverstone on Saturday, Daniel said:
OL,8,F"Follow your dreams and don't give up."
